Day 06 Summary

Day 06 focused on advanced combinational logic, code conversion, display decoding, shifting, and basic error detection.

The overall workflow followed was:

Concept
   ↓
Logic / Truth Table
   ↓
RTL Design
   ↓
Testbench
   ↓
ModelSim Simulation
   ↓
Waveform Verification
   ↓
GitHub Documentation

The six main circuits completed during Day 06 were:

1. 4-bit Right Barrel Shifter
2. Binary → Gray
3. Gray → Binary
4. BCD → 7-Segment
5. Even Parity Generator
6. Even Parity Checker

Day 06 builds on the combinational RTL concepts from previous days and introduces practical applications of shifting, code conversion, display control, and error detection.
